{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This plugin enables animations on actors when using the \u201cFront-view\u201d mode of the battle scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also allows you to use a sprite sheet for your actors, instead of a static face sprite, within the battle status window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Add damage pop ups in the battle status window for front view battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Allows you to use SV battler sprites instead of static face sprites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Allows you to use animated face sprites instead of static face sprites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A demo project is included for reference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis pack is for use in RPG Maker Series or the engine of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOK to be used in Commercial projects made in RPG Maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou may modify some of the assets (but not redistribute them) for your own game use only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024310?t=1758761820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024310?t=1758761820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024310/7fad8a84a7cac99350dc2f7f5a1eaa45be046301/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758761820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024310/7fad8a84a7cac99350dc2f7f5a1eaa45be046301/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758761820","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","